  "description": "Gang-Gu prepares to become a civil servant leaving behind the title of Go prodigy . Bong-Nak, an eccentric teacher, approaches Gang-Gu. \n\n“Wouldn’t you like to compete in an Omok competition?” \n\nA story about the lives of Gang-Gu and Bong-Nak. \n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated) \n\n*Note: Omok is a type of Gomoku ('Five in a Row'), an abstract strategy board game played using Go pieces and a Go board.*",
